<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Bringing life and health and gladness</l><l>All around, this heavenly Guest</l><l>Banished unbelief and sadness,</l><l>Changed our weariness to rest.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Like the rain that falls from heaven,</l><l>Like the sunlight from the sky,</l><l>So the Holy Ghost is given,</l><l>Coming to us from on high.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>See a fruitful field is growing</l><l>Blessed fruits of righteousness,</l><l>And the streams of life are flowing</l><l>In the lonely wilderness.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>What a wonderful salvation</l><l>Where we always see His face!</l><l>What a perfect habitation!</l><l>What a quiet resting place!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
